## Important

- `src/settings-menu.css:5`: on close the backdrop runs 300ms and the dialog 150ms, so the backdrop is still at 0.71 opacity at 210ms after the dialog is gone. An overlay and its content move as one, so close them together:

```css
.settings-backdrop {
  transition: opacity 150ms cubic-bezier(0.55, 0, 1, 0.45);
}
```
